  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">Bihar&nbsp;Police Prohibition Constable Exam City Details 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-04T11:27:18+05:30\">June 4, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:27 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://csbc.bihar.gov.in/A-REP.htm\">Central Selection Board of Constable (CSBC)</a>,</strong> has released the <strong>Exam City Details</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Bihar Police Prohibition, Jail Warder, and Mobile Squad Posts. </strong>The&nbsp;<strong>exam</strong>&nbsp;will be conducted on&nbsp;<strong>14 – 17 June 2026,</strong>&nbsp;and the<strong>&nbsp;last date</strong>&nbsp;to submit the application form was&nbsp;<strong>05 November 2025.</strong>&nbsp;Candidates can also check their&nbsp;<strong>Exam City Details</strong>&nbsp;by using their&nbsp;<strong>Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the&nbsp;<strong>portal.&nbsp;The&nbsp;direct link</strong>&nbsp;is provided below.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt.No. 03/2025)</strong></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n